Package: bsd.report
Title: Various Functions Including Assistance with Report Writing
Version: 0.0.0.9106
Authors@R: person("William", "Denney", email = "wdenney@humanpredictions.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Report writing can be made easier by using some simplifying
  functions to help with the text and the conversion to knitr/rmarkdown.
  These functions help with converting R into usable text.  There are many
  other functions in here, too.
